      <span>📌</span> Key Takeaways & Review Points
    </h3>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-amber-900">
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">•</span>
        <span><strong>Core Definition:</strong> Understanding the mechanics of When I Grow Up within AI & Career.</span>
      </li>
