        <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">•</span>
        <span><strong>Hands-on Insight:</strong> Always test hypotheses with diverse datasets and verify outcomes.</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <span class="text-amber-600 font-bold">•</span>
        <span><strong>Next Step:</strong> Complete the associated Chapter Workbook, Practical Activity, and Quiz.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
